  - m_Id: 1236262951
    m_Localized: close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262952
    m_Localized: 'Click one of the options above

      to select it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262953
    m_Localized: 'Click your character and drag

      with the mouse to aim and set

      the power.

      you get to use this once per

      turn before you use a weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262954
    m_Localized: 'click here if you want to finish

      your turn without using a

      weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262955
    m_Localized: 'click here to cancel and select

      another player.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262956
    m_Localized: Computer, take your turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262957
    m_Localized: Player {0}, take your turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262958
    m_Localized: collected {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262959
    m_Localized: loading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262960
    m_Localized: cherry bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262961
    m_Localized: 'Basic weak weapon which

      explodes on impact.

      Click the cherry bomb and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262962
    m_Localized: dynamite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262963
    m_Localized: 'This weapon explodes when it

      comes to rest.

      Click the dynamite and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262964
    m_Localized: boulder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262965
    m_Localized: 'Large boulder which can bash

      other players out of the way.

      Click the boulder and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262966
    m_Localized: pieces of eight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262967
    m_Localized: 'Eight coins which inflict a small

      amount of damage. You get

      eight turns with this weapon.

      Click each one and drag to aim

      and set the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262968
    m_Localized: rum bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262969
    m_Localized: 'This weapon explodes on impact

      and sets the nearby area on fire.

      Click it and drag

      with your mouse to aim and set

      the power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262970
    m_Localized: banana
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262971
    m_Localized: 'This weapon is very bouncy.

      Click and drag with the mouse

      to aim and set the power.

      Then click your mouse again to

      make it explode.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262972
    m_Localized: parachute bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262973
    m_Localized: 'Click and drag with the mouse

      to aim and set the power.

      As it drifts down use

      your cursor as a fan to push it

      left or right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262974
    m_Localized: crates
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262975
    m_Localized: 'Click anywhere on the stage to

      place down three crates.

      use these to form a wall to

      protect your characters.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262976
    m_Localized: gunpowder barrels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262977
    m_Localized: 'Click anywhere on the stage to

      place down two barrels.

      these will explode when hit by

      a weapon.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262978
    m_Localized: seagull
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262979
    m_Localized: 'Click on the screen to choose a

      path for the seagull to fly.

      Then click repeatedly to poop

      on the enemy!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262980
    m_Localized: mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262981
    m_Localized: 'Click the mine and drag

      with the mouse to aim and

      set the power.

      It will detonate when

      another player moves nearby.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262982
    m_Localized: cannon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262983
    m_Localized: 'Drag the cannon into position

      within the circle.

      click and drag the pin at the

      back to turn the cannon.

      release it to fire!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262984
    m_Localized: anchor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262985
    m_Localized: 'Click anywhere in the stage to

      drop a huge anchor down

      onto enemies!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262986
    m_Localized: voodoo doll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262987
    m_Localized: 'choose an enemy player by

      clicking on them. then click

      and drag to throw the doll and

      watch the enemy helplessly

      fly off in the same direction!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262988
    m_Localized: tidal wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1236262989
    m_Localized: 'click to send a huge tidal wave

      across the bottom of the stage.

      It will affect all players it

      hits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
